Z||000000||CFOG-International||10-26-2001||07:14 PM||||We will be holding our Board of Director's meeting in our online chat<BR>room at 6:00 pm (Pacific Standard Time) on Tuesday, October 30, 2001.<P>Please advise me by email if you can NOT be online at that time.<P><P>------------------<BR>Terry Owens, Chairman<BR><A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank>CFOG-International</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||CFOG-International||10-30-2001||11:59 AM||||The Board of Director's meeting will take place tonight at 6:00 PM (PST)<P>Also, I have posted a complete current membership database on the Director's page for your use. Also, you will find a club presentation you may use when contacting clubs in your area.<P>Thanks again to all of you who have chosen to participate in this organization. The growth and organization of this group is outstanding!!||||reg||1
Z||000002||CFOG-International||11-08-2001||12:13 PM||||The Board of Director's meeting was held as scheduled and was extremely successful. Final plans are being made for the scheduled release of the club magazine as well as the two national shows in 2002.<P>Just a proven fact that online meetings can be held in this day and age of technology!!||||reg||1
